{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"node --version\nnpm --version\ncommand -v pnpm || true\ncommand -v yarn || true\nrg -n 'niceeval|FastAPI|Flask|Django|Express|system under test|API|server|agent' README* pyproject.toml requirements*.txt setup.cfg setup.py Cargo.toml go.mod 2>/dev/null | sed -n '1,160p'\"","aggregated_output":"v24.19.0\n11.17.0\n/usr/local/bin/pnpm\n/usr/local/bin/yarn\nREADME-zh_CN.md:80:- 参考资料（API完整文档）\nREADME-zh_CN.md:103:> **第 3 步** - 使用 OpenAI 密钥和 Tavily API 密钥创建 .env 文件，或直接导出该文件\nREADME-zh_CN.md:106:$ export OPENAI_API_KEY={Your OpenAI API Key here}\nREADME-zh_CN.md:109:$ export TAVILY_API_KEY={Your Tavily API Key here}\nREADME-zh_CN.md:116:# $ export LANGCHAIN_API_KEY={Your LangChain API Key here}\nREADME-zh_CN.md:120:- **对于搜索引擎，我们推荐使用 [Tavily Search API](https://app.tavily.com)（已针对 LLM 进行优化）**，但您也可以选择其他搜索引擎，只需将 gpt_researcher/config/variables/default.py 中的搜索提供程序更改为 \"duckduckgo\"、\"googleAPI\"、\"searchapi\"、\"googleSerp \"或 \"searx \"即可。然后在 gpt_researcher/config/variables/default.py 文件中添加相应的 env API 密钥。\nREADME-zh_CN.md:121:- **我们强烈建议使用 [OpenAI GPT](https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/gpt) 模型和 [Tavily Search API](https://app.tavily.com) 以获得最佳性能。**\nREADME-zh_CN.md:124:> **第 4 步** - 使用 FastAPI 运行代理\nREADME-zh_CN.md:143:   export LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=您的_API_KEY\nREADME-zh_CN.md:166:**请注意，使用 GPT-4 语言模型可能会因使用令牌而产生高昂费用**。使用本项目即表示您承认有责任监控和管理自己的令牌使用情况及相关费用。强烈建议您定期检查 OpenAI API 的使用情况，并设置任何必要的限制或警报，以防止发生意外费用。\nsetup.py:25:    description=\"GPT Researcher is an autonomous agent designed for comprehensive web research on any task\",\npyproject.toml:4:description = \"GPT Researcher is an autonomous agent designed for comprehensive online research on a variety of tasks.\"\npyproject.toml:67:description = \"GPT Researcher is an autonomous agent designed for comprehensive online research on a variety of tasks.\"\nREADME-ko_KR.md:84:- 참고자료 (전체 API 문서)\nREADME-ko_KR.md:97:> **3단계** - 두 가지 방법으로 API 키를 설정하세요: 직접 export하거나 `.env` 파일에 저장하세요.\nREADME-ko_KR.md:102:export OPENAI_API_KEY={OpenAI API 키 입력}\nREADME-ko_KR.md:103:export TAVILY_API_KEY={Tavily API 키 입력}\nREADME-ko_KR.md:110:# export LANGCHAIN_API_KEY={LangChain API 키 입력}\nREADME-ko_KR.md:126:> **2단계** - FastAPI로 에이전트 실행\nREADME-ko_KR.md:162:> **2단계** - `.env.example` 파일을 복사하고 API 키를 추가한 후, 파일을 `.env`로 저장하세요.\nREADME-ko_KR.md:184:   export LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=당신의_API_키\nREADME-ko_KR.md:211:[여기](https://github.com/assafelovic/gpt-researcher/tree/master/multi_agents)에서 확인하거나 [문서](https://docs.gptr.dev/docs/gpt-researcher/multi_agents/langgraph)에서 자세한 내용을 참조하세요.\nREADME-ko_KR.md:223:1. FastAPI로 제공되는 경량 정적 프론트엔드\nREADME-ko_KR.md:249:**GPT-4 모델을 사용할 경우, 토큰 사용량 때문에 비용이 많이 들 수 있습니다.** 이 프로젝트를 사용하는 경우, 자신의 토큰 사용량 및 관련 비용을 모니터링하고 관리하는 것은 본인의 책임입니다. OpenAI API 사용량을 정기적으로 확인하고, 예상치 못한 비용을 방지하기 위해 필요한 한도를 설정하거나 알림을 설정하는 것이 좋습니다.\nREADME.md:25:**GPT Researcher the first open deep research agent designed for both web and local research on any given task.** \nREADME.md:27:The agent produces detailed, factual, and unbiased research reports with citations. GPT Researcher provides a full suite of customization options to create tailor made and domain specific research agents. Inspired by the recent [Plan-and-Solve](https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.04091) and [RAG](https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.11401) papers, GPT Researcher addresses misinformation, speed, determinism, and reliability by offering stable performance and increased speed through parallelized agent work.\nREADME.md:56:The core idea is to utilize 'planner' and 'execution' agents. The planner generates research questions, while the execution agents gather relevant information. The publisher then aggregates all findings into a comprehensive report.\nREADME.md:63:* Create a task-specific agent based on a research query.\nREADME.md:65:* Use a crawler agent for gathering information for each question.\nREADME.md:92:- Full API references\nREADME.md:106:3. Set up API keys by exporting them or storing them in a `.env` file.\nREADME.md:109:    export OPENAI_API_KEY={Your OpenAI API Key here}\nREADME.md:110:    export TAVILY_API_KEY={Your Tavily API Key here}\nREADME.md:117:    # export LANGCHAIN_API_KEY={Your LangChain API Key here}\nREADME.md:120:    For custom OpenAI-compatible APIs (e.g., local models, other providers), you can also set:\nREADME.md:123:    export OPENAI_BASE_URL={Your custom API base URL here}\nREADME.md:126:4. Install dependencies and start the server:\nREADME.md:159:GPT Researcher supports MCP integration to connect with specialized data sources like GitHub repositories, databases, and custom APIs. This enables research from data sources alongside web search.\nREADME.md:175:        query=\"What are the top open source web research agents?\",\nREADME.md:180:                \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-github\"],\nREADME.md:200:GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key\nREADME.md:215:GPT Researcher now includes Deep Research - an advanced recursive research workflow that explores topics with agentic depth and breadth. This feature employs a tree-like exploration pattern, diving deeper into subtopics while maintaining a comprehensive view of the research subject.\nREADME.md:229:> **Step 2** - Clone the '.env.example' file, add your API Keys to the cloned file and save the file as '.env'\nREADME.md:243: - the Python server running on localhost:8000<br>\nREADME.md:266:We've moved our MCP server to a dedicated repository: [gptr-mcp](https://github.com/assafelovic/gptr-mcp).\nREADME.md:280:As AI evolves from prompt engineering and RAG to multi-agent systems, we're excited to introduce multi-agent assistants built with [LangGraph](https://python.langchain.com/v0.1/docs/langgraph/) and [AG2](https://github.com/ag2ai/ag2).\nREADME.md:282:By using multi-agent frameworks, the research process can be significantly improved in depth and quality by leveraging multiple agents with specialized skills. Inspired by the recent [STORM](https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.14207) paper, this project showcases how a team of AI agents can work together to conduct research on a given topic, from planning to publication.\nREADME.md:286:Check it out [here](https://github.com/assafelovic/gpt-researcher/tree/master/multi_agents) or head over to our documentation for [LangGraph](https://docs.gptr.dev/docs/gpt-researcher/multi_agents/langgraph) and [AG2](https://docs.gptr.dev/docs/gpt-researcher/multi_agents/ag2) for more information.\nREADME.md:290:GPT Researcher supports **LangSmith** for enhanced tracing and observability, making it easier to debug and optimize complex multi-agent workflows.\nREADME.md:296:   export LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=your_api_key\nREADME.md:299:2. Run your research tasks as usual. All LangGraph-based agent interactions will be automatically traced and visualized in your LangSmith dashboard.\nREADME.md:311:1. A lightweight static frontend served by FastAPI\nREADME-ja_JP.md:81:- 参考資料（API完全ドキュメント）\nREADME-ja_JP.md:104:> **ステップ 3** - OpenAI キーと Tavily API キーを使用して .env ファイルを作成するか、直接エクスポートします\nREADME-ja_JP.md:107:$ export OPENAI_API_KEY={Your OpenAI API Key here}\nREADME-ja_JP.md:110:$ export TAVILY_API_KEY={Your Tavily API Key here}\nREADME-ja_JP.md:117:# $ export LANGCHAIN_API_KEY={Your LangChain API Key here}\nREADME-ja_JP.md:121:- **検索エンジンには、[Tavily Search API](https://app.tavily.com)（LLM 用に最適化されています）を使用することをお勧めします**が、他の検索エンジンを選択することもできます。config/config.py で検索プロバイダーを「duckduckgo」、「googleAPI」、「googleSerp」、「searchapi」、「searx」に変更するだけです。次に、config.py ファイルに対応する env API キーを追加します。\nREADME-ja_JP.md:122:- **最適なパフォーマンスを得るために、[OpenAI GPT](https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/gpt) モデルと [Tavily Search API](https://app.tavily.com) を使用することを強くお勧めします。**\nREADME-ja_JP.md:125:> **ステップ 4** - FastAPI を使用してエージェントを実行します\nREADME-ja_JP.md:144:   export LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=あなたのAPIキー\nREADME-ja_JP.md:167:**GPT-4 言語モデルの使用は、トークンの使用により高額な費用がかかる可能性があることに注意してください**。このプロジェクトを利用することで、トークンの使用状況と関連する費用を監視および管理する責任があることを認めたことになります。OpenAI API の使用状況を定期的に確認し、予期しない料金が発生しないように必要な制限やアラートを設定することを強くお勧めします。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
